{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "28ecd7541ad851b0ce2f236b37a5f350f63b0daca869eb3b79f49aee2e3ef161", "ja": "歌おう、サンリズム・オーケストラ♪", "zh": "唱吧，阳光律动管弦乐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5be3fb9c356302c563d9204848e1fb4bd6341891a76a03d6587bb3b045163fe1", "ja": "本番前日、リハーサルを見たプロデューサー\nは、メンバーの成長を実感する。エレナにコ\nメントを求められ、もう少しダンスを大きく\nしてみようと提案。太陽にも届きそうなかけ\n声と共に、5人は公演に臨むのだった。", "zh": "制作人在开演的前一天看完排练后，\n切实感受到成员们的成长。\n艾琳娜向制作人寻求建议，\n于是他提议让舞蹈动作再夸大一点。\n伴随要响彻太阳的口号，五人展开了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d6288779482914e8ab8886de01509873c86b296f2343a81435be20368ff4f738", "ja": "（本番と同じ衣装での通しリハが終わった。明日は\nいよいよ公演初日。5人とも気合いが入ってるな！）", "zh": "（穿上正式服装进行的排练完成了，\n明天就是公演第一天，五个人都很有干劲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "943eb3d138bfa4f32e41ef7945dc88bca5744f91e30808f6d093afe992ee391c", "ja": "リハーサル、みんなバッチリでしたね♪\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "排练大家都表现得很完美呢♪\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "82106df084c5ccece13c048d37f525681e30546fa54722b5304417c29267f7c7", "ja": "ああ、楽しいステージだったよ。\nみんなも、よくやったな！", "zh": "嗯，是场很开心的表演喔。\n各位都表现得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "83318e2a950cb82748cd76875a3ff43e2503be235ec09137077652356f302ef9", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、今日はずーっと元気だったよね。\nふふっ、やっぱりステージが楽しみなせい？", "zh": "可奈今天一直都很有活力呢。\n呵呵，果然是因为很期待表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "e8641a66b45aebc893c6c9509adf453223076b85687adf58096880c234718d25", "ja": "はいっ♪　あ、でも今はほら！　ここから\nトッテモタカイツリーが見えるな～と思って！", "zh": "是的♪啊，不过现在是因为我在想呀，\n原来从这里看得见高耸入云塔耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fe81dd28183f4ce33537be494d83349ffc639352f7e4fd3a9dd3f5d6f7c166e9", "ja": "あ、ホントだ～！\n天気がいいから、よく見えるね♪", "zh": "啊，真的耶～！\n天气好的话看得清楚呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "a1e55d05fdac9d1e18ef5ad6243011cfc9286c9c8eca4949e3e8987dcdafd8f0", "ja": "ありゃ～、あんなに高いところに、\nあたしたち、登ってたのかい。", "zh": "啊呀～原来我们曾经爬到\n那么高的地方哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "7f808b1f3091b9960a42d74e5cb21ad2386effef3ce738d01256fe2e893c9f2a", "ja": "ずーっと遠くまで見えて、\nとってもエキサイティングだったよネ♪", "zh": "能看得很远很远，\n真的是非常刺激呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8a44387e5b5447b5d06aea95c2771d4f4f7e86ab613e6fd07be0019241e8c3c4", "ja": "みんなでツリーに登ってから今日まで、\nいろいろなことがあったけど……。", "zh": "从大家一起爬塔到今天，\n虽然发生过许多事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8bbf92493bc23aba365b691cb1e584995119373960ae7225ecee83302cd68a92", "ja": "みんな、すごく成長してくれたと思う。\nよく頑張ってくれたな！", "zh": "不过我认为大家都成长了很多，\n你们做得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e534ff4877bcb2fa3e67e728c2e7e0dc4a1f287b68c70080b9867356b2ac95cd", "ja": "可奈ちゃんも、今なら音程バッチリだもんね～♪\nクラリネットで歌の練習できるって、いいな～。", "zh": "可奈现在音准都没问题了呢～♪\n用竖笛也能练习唱歌，好羡慕喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "ffebaf29d5c60dc197aaa8f8358ab8ede5894dfb8b9c2ffc7c1c0c2f6370a216", "ja": "えへへっ、やったー！\n翼ちゃんにほめられちゃった～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了──！\n被小翼夸奖了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "336c94c094b57676c43b6360c7c8081e67b480324ff85beb03b89ca68af2bea2", "ja": "（可奈はしっかり練習したり、クラリネットで何度も\n演奏すると、ちゃんと歌えるようになる）", "zh": "（可奈认真练习，又不断吹奏竖笛，\n现在已经能唱得很好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cf2a03ed9a28f038f63d3a91e62a15f45cc2e6a66a0e5b0086e1a68a0c985282", "ja": "（ただ、何日か経つと忘れてしまうんだが……。\nまあ、当分は大丈夫だろう）", "zh": "（只是容易过了几天就忘记……\n算了，反正暂时是没问题吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "f018067a5c80f398597659b63038cd5a99e0cb0a7545a58d5d328be2cab4308d", "ja": "そうだ、{$P$}！\nせっかくだから明日に向かってひと言、お願いネ♪", "zh": "对了，{$P$}！\n难得的机会，请对明天的公演说几句话吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3f71ab80364aa6e719cc60de5b5d5a7c2ffa1ab6243cc0f6213f10b421cc4a39", "ja": "うん？　そうだな、それじゃ……。", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7eab3188e5377086fa6539a9fa27f6c8d0c71d5741a9caa97ebd97884c7c7225", "ja": "みんなは今までのレッスンで、歌もダンスも、\nもうバッチリだと思う。だからこそ……。", "zh": "我想大家透过至今的训练，不论唱歌还是跳舞，\n都已经趋近完美了，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "058d9b8d54c0023efcf38f38a6030ae22a73a72d5e3df0bb1824571b6cd620ed", "ja": "明日は今日よりも、少しだけ。\n5センチだけ大きく踊ってみてくれないか？", "zh": "比起今天，明天就更大胆一点，\n试着把舞蹈动作拉大五公分如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "312fcbe195be4ab0d212f585902812bf6da031f86dc433d414d497041f483c4d", "ja": "え？　5センチ大きく？", "zh": "咦？拉大五公分？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e8d84b2f24bb05d8a2e8635b3279675ff2be9c3097b9f86d5790687a067487c0", "ja": "ああ。そしたらきっと、気持ちが自由になる。大きくて\n楽しい、太陽みたいなステージになると思うんだ。", "zh": "没错，这么一来你们的心就会更自由，\n表现出更广阔更开心，像太阳一样的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "cb5353236ae2f724600506b244d5429dcb37d7c99e4f45386f384061d350fae0", "ja": "アハッ、きっとそうだネ！\nさすが{$P$}だヨー♪", "zh": "啊哈，肯定是这样！\n真不愧是{$P$}耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "5af33cd9d9e8e04e6b98dfec5431561d99911cc8c2f9837894e233a209e1846a", "ja": "それじゃ、がんばって、\nちょっこし大きく踊って……。", "zh": "那么，我们就努力，\n舞蹈动作稍微跳大一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4257224a9856d952809a506d050fc3d30ada933afd5d23a07e1a29d60c5e7c20", "ja": "うん♪　太陽みたいに、輝いちゃいまーす！", "zh": "嗯♪要像太阳一样闪耀──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "5c84304e71ac95b25352d1d88b5172a6f64918bc2d2e8f4643dce3ce447dde2b", "ja": "じゃあ、最後は例のかけ声で、気合いを入れよっか！\nはい、可奈ちゃん、お願いね！", "zh": "那么，最后就用那句口号来打起干劲吧！\n来，可奈，交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "439da224a592641cf1e08fe3ac71da14cbab1900243497aac34b076c5b722980", "ja": "え、私！？　わ、わかりました～！\nえっと……みんな、行くよ～！　せーのっ！", "zh": "咦，我！？我、我知道了～！\n呃……大家，开始啰～！预备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_06_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "68ed512d12f5009730db16af3cffed3a91efa6a72c651759cdd9ae45428575b5", "ja": "手を取り合って、輪になって！\n歌おう、サンリズム・オーケストラ♪", "zh": "手牵手，围成一圈！\n唱吧，阳光律动管弦乐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
